cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Stormwater Atlas data or the draft model manual, please cite it as below."
title: "Stormwater Atlas: a database of U.S. stormwater design manuals"
type: dataset
version: "2026.11.0"
date-released: "2026-11-18"
url: "https://www.stormwateratlas.com/data/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/scott-jeffers/usa-stormwater"
authors:
  - name: "Scott Jeffers"
keywords:
  - stormwater
  - design manuals
  - green infrastructure
  - water quality
  - model manual
abstract: >-
  Key design requirements extracted from U.S. federal, state, county and city
  stormwater design manuals, each value with its source quote, page and a
  machine check against the source PDF, plus hand-checked state-level values
  and a draft model stormwater design manual built on them.
